{"full":"hf:Ex0bit/qwen-scope-live","spaceId":"Ex0bit/qwen-scope-live","name":"Qwen-Scope: Decoding Intelligence, Unleashing Potential","source":"huggingface","description":"Live SAE feature steering for Qwen3-1.7B","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":20,"created":"2026-04-30T21:59:58.000Z","updated":"2026-04-30T22:00:21.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://ex0bit-qwen-scope-live.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Ex0bit/qwen-scope-live","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.668Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.668Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.668Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🔬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live, interactive demo of the Qwen-Scope sparse-autoencoder release. Type a prompt, see which SAE features fire, drag a slider to steer them, and watch the model's actual generated text change in real time — all running in your browser against Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B-Base + the layer-14 (and layer-selectable) Qwen-Scope SAE.","This Space implements three of the four pillars from the Qwen-Scope paper:","(The fourth pillar — Post-training pathology diagnosis — is not yet implemented.)"],"features":["Steering — interpretable feature-level control at inference time (per-token heatmap, position-selective steering, output-only steering, per-token probability panel with click-to-pin top-K candidates)","Evaluation — capability-aware corpus analysis (paste a prompt set, encode each, see which features fire across the corpus; compare two prompt sets for distinguishing features)","Data-centric — feature-guided curation (filter docs by feature signature) and steered synthesis (bulk-generate steered completions from seed prompts)"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Ex0bit/qwen-scope-live/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"245a7ea67b679cf074aad975bcbec1c6f1964ef143c8544f777